1
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,740
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,740
=Episode 4=

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,740
(You had an affair with Prince Su!)

4
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,720
Calm yourself, Your Highness!

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,280
(Qingzi, Senior Palace Maid)
Don't let anger harm you.

6
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,400
All of you, leave.

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,560
As you wish, Your Highness!

8
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:33,240
That fool, Zhaoyi Shen.

9
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,760
Can't even handle a lowly Cairen.

10
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:37,920
All my grooming of her, wasted!

11
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:41,400
Your Highness, Cairen Rong's
in the cold palace now,

12
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,200
she can't make waves.

13
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:44,240
Qingzi.

14
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,200
Send word to the cold palace.

15
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:48,800
Tell Zhaoyi Shen to
finish Fu Rong there.

16
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,600
If she fails again,

17
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:53,800
her daughter will end up like Lingxi.

18
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:55,320
Yes, Your Highness.

19
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:08,800
Mother loves you!

20
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,280
Don't cry.

21
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:11,560
Let's look at the baby.

22
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:12,440
Look at my baby.

23
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,120
Why so angry?

24
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,120
Come here.

25
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,400
Look at my baby.

26
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:21,680
Good child, huh?

27
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,480
Sister.

28
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:25,160
Was mugwort burned here yesterday?

29
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,000
Why would anyone burn it?

30
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:33,600
Who was burning mugwort yesterday?

31
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,880
Do you know?

32
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,000
Newcomer,

33
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,640
are you also one
of His Majesty's consorts?

34
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,560
(Auntie Sun, Cold Palace Steward)
Chatting away, are we?

35
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:49,640
What?

36
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:52,240
Still think you're some highborn lady?

37
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,040
Let me tell you,

38
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:56,560
I don't care what title you had before.

39
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,640
In the cold palace,
you're lower than dogs!

40
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,560
You'll all behave!

41
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,000
And do as I say!

42
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,520
I'll beat you!

43
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,480
Auntie Sun.

44
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,120
Fu Rong.

45
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,240
No matter where,

46
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:32,160
I can crush you under my feet.

47
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,440
In this cold palace,

48
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,680
I could squeeze you

49
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,800
dead as easily as an ant.

50
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:41,880
You went to all that trouble
to send me here.

51
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,400
What can you do to me?

52
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,840
What can I do?

53
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,000
A life for a life.

54
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,160
Believe me?

55
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:55,120
You won't leave here alive.

56
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:57,280
A life for a life?

57
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:02,240
A lowborn wretch birthing a brat...

58
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,160
You think she's worth my life?

59
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:06,000
She's dead, so what?

60
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,120
No one will care.

61
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,880
Let me tell you, Fu Rong,

62
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,840
The one who won't leave this cold palace

63
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:14,960
will be you.

64
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,280
Accept your fate.

65
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,440
She was just a child.

66
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,360
If you want revenge, come after me!

67
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:23,160
Why hurt an innocent child?

68
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:27,760
Blame your own cleverness!

69
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,240
Have you seen her?

70
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,240
And that madwoman?

71
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,720
They overestimated themselves.

72
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:37,120
That's what happens
when they challenge me.

73
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,080
And you, Fu Rong...

74
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:42,480
will fare even worse.

75
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,280
Don't get so full of yourself.

76
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,120
I swear to heaven,

77
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,840
within ten days,

78
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,360
I'll make you

79
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:03,440
beg on your knees.

80
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,280
Fine.

81
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,400
I'll wait and see

82
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,280
which one of us

83
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:13,280
ends up begging for mercy!

84
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,640
Don't be afraid, sweetheart.

85
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,040
Scrub it properly!

86
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,400
Oh, little one,

87
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:42,720
just take one bite.

88
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,480
Why won't you eat?

89
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,280
I'm sorry!

90
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:51,800
Get lost!

91
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:56,080
I'm sorry! Don't hit me!

92
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:58,920
Listen here.

93
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:01,800
Stop blocking my way with that brat!

94
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:04,240
I'll beat you every time I see you!

95
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:05,880
Get lost!

96
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,000
Get back to work!

97
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:09,560
Move it!

98
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,200
Your child...

99
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:17,800
My baby!

100
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,680
Are you all right?

101
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,800
Mother's here.

102
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,400
Don't be scared.

103
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:24,080
How did you lose your child?

104
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:26,040
Ghosts!

105
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,720
The ghosts will hear!

106
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:29,960
It's broad daylight,

107
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:30,880
no ghosts now.

108
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,600
There are! Really!

109
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,960
Ghost fire floats in the backyard.

110
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,280
It's terrifying!

111
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,400
Burn mugwort to ward them off.

112
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,720
Or they'll drag you away!

113
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,120
Or possess you!

114
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:49,160
So the mugwort is to ward off ghosts.

115
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:52,000
Who burned it?

116
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:54,800
Ghosts...

117
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,240
Ghosts!

118
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,280
Ghosts!

119
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,280
A ghost is after me!

120
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,320
It's after me!

121
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,080
(Mugwort wards off ghosts.)

122
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,840
(What are you really up to?)

123
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,240
Get back to work!

124
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,840
No slacking! Hurry!

125
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:07,200
No dinner till the work is done!

126
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:14,000
Ah, Physician Li.

127
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:17,120
It's your turn to
examine them this month.

128
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,280
These madwomen here...

129
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,880
You came yourself to tend them?

130
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:24,080
What a burden this must be.

131
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:25,680
You're too kind.

132
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,920
I just joined the Imperial Hospital.

133
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,360
I should serve the inner palace well.

134
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,680
Treating patients is my duty.

135
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:33,480
This monthly cold palace duty...

136
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:36,160
All the physicians avoid it.

137
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,160
These discarded consorts...

138
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,240
You never know.

139
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,400
One or two could die any day.

140
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:45,000
There's no merit for curing them,

141
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,840
but if one dies,

142
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,720
the blame will fall on you.

143
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,000
It matters not.

144
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:58,240
Put down your work and line up!

145
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:00,520
Physician Li will check your pulse.

146
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:01,720
Hurry up!

147
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,440
Put your work down!

148
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:10,840
That's enough.

149
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,240
Move.

150
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:23,120
No...

151
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:23,960
Physician Li.

152
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:24,760
The cold palace

153
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,880
is quite complicated.

154
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:27,240
Please bear with us.

155
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:30,040
Move!

156
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:32,520
Bear with us.

157
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,240
Madwoman, you dared run!

158
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,440
Running, huh?!

159
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,440
Physician Li,

160
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:46,360
could you identify this for me?

161
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,920
It's plant ash mixed with phosphorus

162
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:03,560
drawn from decayed plants.

163
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:06,200
Sprinkled on the alum,
it burns on its own.

164
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:09,040
I see.

165
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:12,360
It burns with a blue-green flame,

166
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,200
like ghost fire.

167
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,880
I heard you'd been sent to
the cold palace,

168
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,520
so I came to see you.

169
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,000
I heard about your child.

170
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:26,120
My condolences.

171
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:35,080
You insisted we part ways back then

172
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,720
and enter the palace.

173
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:37,720
I didn't stop you.

174
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,240
But I must remind you now.

175
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,240
Your life comes first.

176
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,800
Don't throw it away.

177
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,520
Thank you.

178
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:03,320
Wandering spirits,

179
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,360
wrath unspent.

180
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,360
Wandering spirits,

181
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,640
wrath unspent.

182
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,960
Wandering spirits,

183
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,840
wrath unspent.

184
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:15,880
Wandering spirits,

185
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,080
wrath unspent.

186
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:21,840
Why aren't you all inside and asleep?

187
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:24,880
I still have to burn mugwort for you.

188
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:25,840
Goodness!

189
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,400
Get inside, now!

190
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,760
Anyone who wanders off

191
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:30,120
may be possessed by evil spirits.

192
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:32,160
You'll drop dead on the spot!

193
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,120
Get inside!

194
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,880
Driving ghosts, wrath unspent.

195
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:42,120
Wandering spirits,

196
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:44,080
wrath unspent.

197
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,240
Wandering spirits,

198
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:48,080
wrath unspent.

199
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:28,160
(The mugwort has a sleeping drug added.)

200
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,400
(Everyone's knocked out.)

201
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:48,480
(Noble Consort Hui.)

202
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:51,200
(You had an affair with Prince Su!)

203
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,240
(You disgraced the harem.)

204
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:55,800
(You handed this to me yourself.)

205
00:13:58,620 --> 00:14:03,140
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

206
00:14:03,460 --> 00:14:08,180
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

207
00:14:08,300 --> 00:14:12,980
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

208
00:14:13,180 --> 00:14:17,820
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

209
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:22,580
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

210
00:14:22,980 --> 00:14:27,620
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

211
00:14:27,780 --> 00:14:32,420
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

212
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:37,380
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

213
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:42,140
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

214
00:14:42,380 --> 00:14:45,880
♪Let the stars and sea♪

215
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:46,750
(Changsheng Gate)

216
00:14:46,750 --> 00:14:50,900
♪Wait for your return♪
